# ==============================================================================
# SkillLoop Frontend (@skillloop/web) — Environment Variables Example
# Konfigurasikan variabel ini pada dashboard Vercel (Project Frontend).
# PERINGATAN: Hanya variabel berawalan VITE_ yang terekspos ke browser.
# JANGAN PERNAH memasukkan DATABASE_URL, SESSION_SECRET, atau password di sini!
# ==============================================================================

# URL domain backend Railway (tanpa trailing slash, otomatis mengarah ke /api/v1)
# Contoh production: https://your-backend-domain.up.railway.app
# Kosongkan saat development lokal agar menggunakan Vite proxy (`/api/v1`)
VITE_API_URL="https://your-backend-domain.up.railway.app"
